  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──あれ？　いや、こんばんは……？\r\nこの時間迷うなぁ……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『こんにちはー！』\r\n『こんばんは！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ありがとうございます……！\r\n改めまして、何時でもいけるやつで失礼します……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "みんな、お疲れ様です！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "放課後クライマックスガールズ、\r\nチョコアイドルの園田智代子です！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "配信見ていただいてありがとうございます！\r\n早速ですが、今日がなんの日かご存じでしょうか……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『初披露～～～～！！！！』",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そうです！　このあと『チョコデート・サンデー』を\r\nテレビ初披露させていただきます！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『待ってました～～楽しみ！』\r\n『今週このために頑張ってきたよ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "私もです！\r\n今からの時間も含めて、今日を楽しみにしていました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "初披露が生放送、とっても緊張していますが……！\r\n一緒に盛り上がっていただけたら嬉しいです",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "──……ちなみにですが、\r\nもう『チョコデート・サンデー』はお聴きいただけて……？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『るー！』\r\n『まーす！』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110130,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ありがとうございます、ありがとうございます……！\r\nすっごく可愛い曲ですよね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110140,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "自然と体がリズムに乗っちゃうというか",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110150,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "昨日も家で口ずさんでたら、揺れてたみたいで\r\n『ぴょこぴょこしてる』って母に笑われまして──",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『見たすぎる』\r\n『お母様笑わないであげてー！』",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110160,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そしてやっぱり歌詞の女の子が可愛い！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110170,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "『あなたのいつものカフェ 連れてって』は言えるけど\r\n『油断しないで! かまって!』は伝えられない──",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110180,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そういう絶妙な感じとか……！\r\nすごく応援したい恋で……！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110190,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "初めて歌詞を読ませていただいた時に、\r\nこの可愛さ、余すところなく伝えないと──ってなりました",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『余すところなく伝わってる』\r\n『チョコは歌詞の子そのままだからなんの心配もいらない』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『まさにちょこちゃんの曲』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110200,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えっ、私が歌詞の子……！？\r\nいいんでしょうかそんな……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110210,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "可愛い、なんて言っていただいちゃって……",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『可愛い！！！！！！！！！』\r\n『可愛いよー！』『かわいい♡♡♡』『おねだり上手すぎ』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110220,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "わぁっ、あはは！\r\nありがとうございます、言わせちゃってすみません……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110230,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そういうわけですので、可愛さは\r\nぜひご注目いただきたいポイントです！　頑張ってます！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201001511/2010015110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "『かわいいの擬人化』\r\n『衣装もめちゃめちゃ可愛いもんなー』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2010015110240,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そうなんです、とっても……！\r\n衣装のお気に入りポイントは────",
